From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] qwen3.8: one profile switch for the optimisation patches

VLLM_QWEN38_OPT_PROFILE=default sets VLLM_QWEN38_FAST_MOE_ALIGN,
VLLM_QWEN38_DRAFT_HEAD_FP8, VLLM_QWEN38_THIN_GEMM,
VLLM_QWEN38_PLE_NATIVE_HASH, VLLM_QWEN38_VERIFICATION_WIDTHS,
VLLM_QWEN38_ADAPTIVE_WIDTH, VLLM_QWEN38_PLE_NO_SPEC_BLOCKS,
VLLM_QWEN38_GDN_RECOVER and VLLM_QWEN38_FUSED_SHARED_GATE to 1 unless the
variable is already set (each
switch stays individually overridable). Unset/0/off changes nothing. Applied
from vllm.env_override, before any other vLLM import, in every process. The
switches are registered in vllm.envs so they are not reported as unknown.
